// ROD family — query OWNED by this crate (gathered by `spec_catalog` via
// `[package.metadata.array_vis_bench] query = "rod.avbs"`). Two uncoupled
// exhaustive holes: `strategy` over the RodBranching role (6) x `merge` over the
// RodMerge role (19, sixteen of them the tree merge over each tree and key
// store) -> RodSort x 114 = 114 entries. No helper bindings / coupling
// needed (the two axes are independent, unlike quick's pivot<->partition arity).

RodSorts: SortingAlgorithm = SortingAlgorithm<RodSort<strategy = _, merge = _>>
